{
 "_note": "push/511: Mother of Echoes act-1 QA fixes (2026-11-08, director asked: 'Fix the 4 bugs too'). (1) An Absence summon text no longer shows the raw %target token (summons land on empty ground, so the engine never fills it). (2) Nothing Moves and its Stillness ring skipped the 6 hexes next to the Silence, so a player standing adjacent was never hit; the ring is now the full radius-3 area minus her own hex. (3) An Absence now lasts 5 rounds (was 3) so The Absence Opens debuffs outlive their caster (the engine drops a summon's effects when it leaves); cooldown 3 -> 5 keeps one Absence at a time. (4) Refraction Breaks was a misread of the battle log (the line names the clicked tile), no change. Law 18: the Silence and Sayo are unequipped, the jutsu edited, then re-equipped with their 509 kits by literal id. Hand-built from push/509 items 660/661/680/681/707/708 and the live An Absence record.",
